WEBVTT

00:16:27.412 --> 00:16:31.621
study and work
and adventure and friendship,

00:16:31.662 --> 00:16:33.371
oh, friendship,

00:16:33.412 --> 00:16:36.662
and community and love.

00:16:37.287 --> 00:16:39.037
But most of all,

00:16:39.037 --> 00:16:42.412
I wished to tell him
what Herman Melville wrote,

00:16:42.412 --> 00:16:45.162
that truly "to enjoy bodily warmth,

00:16:45.162 --> 00:16:48.704
some small part of you must be cold,

00:16:48.704 --> 00:16:50.621
for there is no quality in this world

00:16:50.662 --> 00:16:53.371
that is not what it is
merely by contrast."

00:16:53.746 --> 00:16:55.662
Yes, contrast.

00:16:56.204 --> 00:16:58.746
If you are mindful
of what you do not have,

00:16:58.787 --> 00:17:02.121
you may be truly mindful
of what you do have.